docs {
  # Submit ASH Termly Tracking
  
  Submits a termly academic and behavioural tracking record for an ASH student. Accepts a multipart form that includes the student's school results, ASH pre/mid/post-test scores, behavioural ratings, and a file upload of the term result document.
  
  On success, the tracking record is inserted into the database and cached. The endpoint returns the newly created record with a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `create` permission.
  
  ## Request Body (`multipart/form-data`)
  
  ### Student & Session
  
  | Field           | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                          |
  |-----------------|--------|----------|-------------------------------------------------------|
  | studentId       | string | Yes      | Valid UUID referencing an existing ASH student record  |
  | academicSession | string | Yes      | Academic session format — e.g. `2025/2026`            |
  | term            | string | Yes      | One of: `TERM 1`, `TERM 2`, `TERM 3`                 |
  | schoolName      | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                        |
  
  ### School Performance
  
  | Field               | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values |
  |---------------------|--------|----------|------------------------------|
  | schoolNumeracyScore | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  | schoolLiteracyScore | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  | schoolAverage       | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  | schoolPosition      | string | No       | Optional text (e.g. `3rd`)   |
  
  ### Pre-test Scores
  
  | Field                | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|------------------------------|
  | pretestNumeracyScore | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  | pretestLiteracyScore | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  | pretestAverage       | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  
  ### Mid-test Scores
  
  | Field                | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|------------------------------|
  | midtestNumeracyScore | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  | midtestLiteracyScore | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  | midtestAverage       | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  
  ### Post-test Scores
  
  | Field                 | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values |
  |-----------------------|--------|----------|------------------------------|
  | posttestNumeracyScore | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  | posttestLiteracyScore | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  | posttestAverage       | number | No       | Numeric score                |
  
  ### Behavioural Ratings
  
  | Field                    | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values |
  |--------------------------|--------|----------|------------------------------|
  | disciplineRating         | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`      |
  | responsibilityRating     | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`      |
  | leadershipRating         | number | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`      |
  
  ### Observations
  
  | Field                    | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values |
  |--------------------------|--------|----------|------------------------------|
  | notableAchievements      | string | No       | Optional free text           |
  | challengesObserved       | string | No       | Optional free text           |
  | nextTermRecommendations  | string | No       | Optional free text           |
  | mentorName               | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  
  ## File Upload
  
  | Field | MIME Types Accepted | Required | Notes                                                                          |
  |-------|---------------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | file  | PDF, image          | **Yes**  | Term result document. Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/ASH-ASSETS/TERMLY-RESULTS` on Cloudinary |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created ASH termly tracking record.
  
  The created record is also cached under the key `cedarrise:ash:termlytracking:<id>` using the `FORM_DATA` TTL.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                           |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values.   |
  | `400 Bad Request`           | No file was attached to the request.                                  |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Cloudinary upload failed for the term result file.                    |
}
